    "status": "selected_core_source_sections_reviewed",
    "summary": "RoboVerse官方repo已確認，但2026固定commit的MetaSim、trajectory reader與generalization level均有版本變化。已閉合maniskill.pick_cube config-port的初態→PositionShiftChecker→IL SuccessOnce聚合，另讀Zarr產生／載入鏈。發現NaN可令整批checker成功、L2/L3與paper定義錯位，以及trial尾批／normalizer切分問題。",
    "identity_note": "固定paper為Geng等人的RoboVerse: Towards a Unified Platform, Dataset and Benchmark for Scalable and Generalizable Robot Learning，arXiv:2504.18904v1（2025-04-26）。PDF指roboverseorg.github.io，README 134–141題名、作者與arXiv一致，確認RoboVerseOrg/RoboVerse為官方平臺。本文不等於較早同名RoboVerse環境，也不把整合的RLBench、ManiSkill、LIBERO、ARNOLD等資料算成新獨立來源。",
    "discovery_evidence": [
